WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
The numbers far surpassed my record-setting first term.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.040
On our southern border, we have successfully repelled a colossal invasion.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:16.120
And for the last four months, and that's four months in a row, the number of illegal aliens

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:20.440
admitted and entering our country has been zero.

